OL,3,GNEWSASkater delivers medal haul after
OL,4,Asport helps her overcome depression
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ice skater who gave up the sport
OL,7,Fwhen she was 13 before rediscovering it
OL,8,F13 years later following bouts of
OL,9,Fdepression and anxiety during the
OL,10,Fpandemic, is to represent Great Britain
OL,11,Fin a major European competition.
OL,13,FJess Constable from Coventry will take
OL,14,Fpart in the 2026 Swan Challenger at
OL,15,FLake Bled in Slovenia in October.
OL,17,F"During the pandemic I suffered greatly
OL,18,Fas like a lot of people did, with my
OL,19,Fmental health, it had quite a big
OL,20,Feffect on me personally. I lost my job
OL,21,Ftwice during the pandemic. I became
OL,22,Freally depressed, anxious" she said.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
